{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Blind.</b> An adjective for the eye." "And some say that <b>broken</b> is in the hand and חרוץ in the foot, and חרוץ is from the root of כן משפטך אתה חרצת, like גזור." "<b>Wart.</b> Like תבלול. And the conclusion of the matter: we rely on the received tradition and do not lean on our deficient understanding." "<b>These you shall not offer to YHWH.</b> For a freewill offering, a vow; and none of those mentioned may be taken."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:45.603482047Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}